WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.063 --> 00:00:05.646
(intense wind)

00:00:10.502 --> 00:00:12.944
(atmospheric music)

00:00:12.944 --> 00:00:15.069
(airplane motor)

00:00:15.069 --> 00:00:16.345
- Other people would laugh at me.

00:00:16.345 --> 00:00:17.820
In fact, all my friends say we worry

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.230
about you Dilys, you know.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.229
I think even coming out this weekend,

00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:22.267
somebody said oh no be careful.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:23.184
I think that's ridiculous.

00:00:23.184 --> 00:00:26.267
What a better way to die, having fun.

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:31.183
I am a world record-holder
for being the oldest

00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:33.865
woman skydiver in the world.

00:00:33.865 --> 00:00:36.105
I think, if there's
only one way, it's down.

00:00:36.105 --> 00:00:38.543
So even if I've got
slight absent-mindedness,

00:00:38.543 --> 00:00:39.876
I'll be alright.

00:00:43.187 --> 00:00:45.625
I don't worry that my
carpet is rather threadbare

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:48.458
and old, as long as I'm skydiving.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.024
But I do get scared.

00:00:51.024 --> 00:00:53.784
I used to be so scared
that I would drive the car

00:00:53.784 --> 00:00:57.778
up to the drop zone and
think, I could go back.

00:00:57.778 --> 00:00:59.311
I don't have to stay here.

00:00:59.311 --> 00:01:01.784
But I knew if I went away,
I'd never come back again.

00:01:01.784 --> 00:01:05.510
So, so the ecstasy was more than the fear.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:07.340
(airplane motor)

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.430
The first time I jumped
out of an airplane,

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:11.543
I thought I was going to die.

00:01:11.543 --> 00:01:15.825
And as I fell, I thought,
what a mistake, this is death.

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:17.543
I can remember it now.

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:21.710
And then the next second,
I thought, “Oh, I'm flying.”

00:01:23.545 --> 00:01:25.066
(upbeat music)

00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:29.432
Skydiving gives you the most
intense, wonderful feeling.

00:01:29.432 --> 00:01:31.750
I mean, people come down from a jump

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.735
and they all say, “It's better than sex.”

00:01:33.735 --> 00:01:37.735
I mean, take that the way
you like it, but it is.

00:01:47.586 --> 00:01:50.581
I think sometimes we
get pulled down by fear,

00:01:50.581 --> 00:01:53.914
we get pulled down by necessity of work,

00:01:54.784 --> 00:01:56.386
and it's a mistake.

00:01:56.386 --> 00:01:59.788
That having done skydiving,
I learned courage.

00:01:59.788 --> 00:02:01.228
I learned to go.

00:02:01.228 --> 00:02:04.223
And that has been the biggest
turning point in my life.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.417
And I think the courage
has helped me to run

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:09.471
a charity, which from
scratch is very difficult.

00:02:09.471 --> 00:02:12.025
They say most charities
fail after three years.

00:02:12.025 --> 00:02:13.906
And I knew that I had a program

00:02:13.906 --> 00:02:16.669
that affected for the
good, very profoundly

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.944
disabled people and made
them really much happier,

00:02:18.944 --> 00:02:20.611
and that thrills me.

00:02:22.184 --> 00:02:24.506
I believe we all have a purpose in life.

00:02:24.506 --> 00:02:28.256
And I believe that Touch
Trust is my purpose.

00:02:32.145 --> 00:02:34.827
I don't have much time
to think about the past.

00:02:34.827 --> 00:02:37.706
I'm so busy in the present and just going

00:02:37.706 --> 00:02:40.550
into the future, that the past recedes.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.940
And I am enjoying so much
these days remembering

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:48.306
the past, remembering
even the difficult times

00:02:48.306 --> 00:02:50.732
that seeing how they
all fell into a pattern,

00:02:50.732 --> 00:02:52.565
which now I'm glad of.

00:02:56.944 --> 00:03:00.310
You are a bird for 50 seconds and imagine,

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:03.751
you can go 140 miles an hour,
you can do a barrel roll.

00:03:03.751 --> 00:03:06.503
You can flip, you can move
here, you can move there,

00:03:06.503 --> 00:03:08.268
you can join up with people.

00:03:08.268 --> 00:03:10.903
It is unbelievably wonderful.

00:03:10.903 --> 00:03:14.061
I won't stop, until I know it's not safe.

00:03:14.061 --> 00:03:17.509
But for now, I'm safe and I can do it,

00:03:17.509 --> 00:03:20.676
and I will do it for as long as I can.

